	<div class="banner">
		<h2>Cat Care &amp; House Rules</h2>
		<p>Please have a read of this before you visit, it helps keep the cats happy and healthy.</p>
	</div>

	<div class="section">
		<h2>Before You Visit</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>Please arrive on time, sessions are kept short so the cats can rest between visits.</li>
			<li>Tell us about any cat allergies when you book.</li>
			<li>Children under 12 must be with an adult.</li>
			<li>Please don't bring outside food or drink for the cats, it can make them ill.</li>
		</ul>

		<h2>While You're Here</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>Let the cat come to you, don't chase or corner them.</li>
			<li>Some cats don't like being picked up, check with staff first.</li>
			<li>Please don't wake a sleeping cat.</li>
			<li>Use the hand sanitiser before and after stroking the cats.</li>
			<li>No flash photography please.</li>
		</ul>
	</div>

	<div class="section">
		<h2>How We Look After the Cats</h2>
		<div class="box-row">
			<div class="box">
				<h3>Health Checks</h3>
				<p>All our cats are vaccinated, microchipped and neutered. A vet visits once a month.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="box blue">
				<h3>Rest Time</h3>
				<p>We close for an hour at lunch and all day Monday so the cats get a proper break.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="box">
				<h3>Safe Spaces</h3>
				<p>Every cat has a shelf or hideaway they can go to if they've had enough attention.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>

